# Student Performance Prediction 

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing student academic performance and predicting student performance categories using Machine Learning.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn
- Google Colab

## Project Workflow
1. Data loading and exploration
2. Data preprocessing
3. Handling missing values
4. Data encoding
5. Exploratory data analysis
6. Decision Tree Classification
7. Model evaluation and visualization

## Machine Learning Model
Decision Tree Classifier

## Objective
To explore student academic data and identify patterns that can help predict student performance.

